            "code": "<h2 id=\"customer-service\" class=\"anchor\">Customer Service</h2><p>We're committed to providing an excellent experience with our products. Have questions? We've got the answers, or contact us today.</p>\t\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/blogs/news/frequently-asked-questions-about-glass-floor-mats\">Read our FAQs  »</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/policies/refund-policy\">Returns & Exchanges  »</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/pages/lifetime-limited-warranty\">Lifetime Limited Warranty  »</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/pages/reviews\">Verified Customer Reviews  »</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us  »</a></li>\n</p>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
